# Gitignored files copied from the repository root into every new Conductor
# workspace. See https://conductor.build/docs/reference/worktreeinclude
#
# Committed on purpose. `.env` is not in git and must not be — it holds
# APP_SECRET and the database password. What is committed is the instruction to
# copy it, never the values.
#
# Without this, a fresh workspace has no `.env`, and `make up` fails on
# Hanami::Settings before it reaches the browser: api_uri and app_secret are
# required and have no usable defaults.
.env
